*.jpeg
# ...except the README screenshots, which are the one set of images
# this repo intentionally ships. Without this, `git add docs/screenshots`
# silently no-ops on new files and the README ends up with broken links.
!docs/screenshots/*.png
test-results/
.design-audit/
